  "details": "# Issue:\n\nSlider Snapping has stopped working for a lot of settings in the current Open Beta.  \n\nNot working in QM:  \n\n- Avatar Culling Hide Beyond  \n\n- Avatar Culling Show Nearest \n\n- Chatbox Display Duration  \n\n- Earmuff Distance  \n\n- Earmuff Falloff Distance  \n\nNot working in MM:\n\n- Audio: Earmuff Distance\n\n- Audio: Earmuff Falloff Distance\n\n- Avatars: Avatar Culling Hide Beyond  \n\n- Avatars: Avatar Culling Show Nearest \n\n- Avatars: Download Prioritize Distance\n\n- Mirrors: Personal Mirror Opacity  \n\n- Mirrors: Face Mirror Opacity  \n\n- User Interface: Nameplate Opacity\n\n- User Interface: Chatbox Display Duration  \n\n- User Interface: Action Menu Opacity\n\n- User Interface: Action Menu Size\n\n(a few are probably missing as I only checked in desktop mode)\n\n# Expected Behavior:  \n\nAll of these should support slider snapping just like before.",
